<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7750"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Skov<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Skov<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 17, 2005 - 12:30 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I think chapter 7. PJ´s might stand for  <BR>&#34;picture Journals&#34;, his collection of photos and drawings of his dead victims, maybe also pictures he took while stalking them. <BR> <BR>By the way I was not the one who found out the PUZZLE; MO ID RUSE theorie, I might have found it somwere else and posted it on this forum, but I didn´t dicover it, wish I did though <IMG SRC="http://www.catchbtk.com/discus/clipart/happy.gif" ALT=":-&#41;" BORDER=0><!--/Text--></td></tr>
