</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 17, 2005 - 12:52 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I get confused sometimes, sorry the PJ thing is great I bet your right, because chapter seven in the original version was about the Fager murders, which he said had nothing to do with him, so he made up his own chapter PJ for pictures. Could you find out who came up with the MO theory so we can get the entire list he came up with. Thanks<!--/Text--></td></tr>
