<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7757"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Iq<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Iq<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 17, 2005 - 12:58 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Tops- <BR>Why do you say it&#39;s &#34;hits&#34;. Everywhere I have looked it says &#34;kits&#34;. Do you have a reliable link that says this is wrong? I just want to make sure I have my facts straight. Thanks. <BR> <BR>iq <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
