<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7765"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:embersageblue@aol.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 17, 2005 - 1:28 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK Chapters <BR>1. All American City- A Serial Killer is Born. <BR>Clue #1 Factor X- Issue #1 1963 Marvel Comics Publication. A mutant is a being who possesses a genetic structure not present in his parents. &#40;From Johno&#41; <BR>2. Dawn-Dawn   <BR>1/15/74 803 N. Edgemoor The Otero Murders <BR>3. Fetish-Fetish <BR>10/74 Letter In the Mech. Eng. Book &#34;Secret Witness Program&#34; 4/4/74 Bright and Vain  <BR>4.Different World&#39;s Collide- Fantasy World <BR>12/8/77 Nancy Fox <BR>5. Vanishing Act- The Search Begins <BR>1/31/78, letter poem about Shirley Vain, the factor x clue, 2/10/78-letter, How many do I have to Kill? <BR>6. Ghost Busters-BTK&#39;s Haunts <BR>The murders where 3 and 1/2 miles apart  <BR>Black Out <BR>7. The Next Step-PJ&#39;s <BR>Because he had nothing to do with the Fager murders, wrote them letters saying so. He made his own chapter which we now think stands for Picture Journals <BR>8. Cold Case Squad- Mo-ID-RUSE <BR>I don&#39;t have the list yet, still need to kind out who solved the puzzle. <BR>MO- Prowl, Fantasies, Follow, Victim, Details, Builds, go for it. <BR>ID- Larry, Anderson, Telephone Co. Gus, Officer <BR>RUSE- Realtor, Insurance, Serviceman, For Sale, Help, Lost Dog. <BR>9. Profile-Hits <BR>In the crime library, they may have hit on a few of his characteristis, not sure yet about this one. <BR>10. Aftermath-Treasured Memories <BR>Letter that he killed Vicki Wegerle, and someone said he may now be giving the police his treasures. <BR>This is where I am so far.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
