<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7774"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rev<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rev<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 17, 2005 - 1:59 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Iq:  According to KAKE last night, Chapter 9 is HITS.  Check out my first post in this thread for the link to the &#34;official&#34; chapter list according to KAKE. <BR> <BR>Kits was just speculated by us because that&#39;s what it looked like from a screen capture.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
