<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7791"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:embersageblue@aol.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 17, 2005 - 3:56 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Thanks to Wichitaboy,  <BR>Chapter &#42;8&#42;  MO-ID-RUSE <BR>MO- Cruise, Sex, Prowl, Fantasies, follow, Spot, Victim, Details, Plan, Steam Builds, Go For It. <BR>ID- Telephone co, Anderson, Larry, School Officer, Wichita, Strong. <BR>RUSE- Realtor, Insurance, Serviceman, Handyman, Wrong Address, Lost Dog, Remodel, Help, Fake ID, Sale, Tag.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7791-->
<!--Post: 7795--><!--Time: 1108685492-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7795"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Skov<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Skov<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 17, 2005 - 4:11 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->The poster of the nickname &#34;IQ&#34; developed the MO ID RUSE theorie further,  here it is: <BR> <BR>I found this on another forum today and found it very interesting:  <BR>--------------------------- <BR>have solved part of his communications !  <BR>I know this isn&#39;t a huge part - But it is something.  <BR> <BR>MO-ID-RUSE - Is the word-find.  <BR> <BR>Look at the first block. The first line says &#34;MO&#34;.These are all of the MOs from the murders.  <BR>Prowl - Fantasies - Follow- Victim - Details - Builds - Go for it &#40;There are more&#41;  <BR> <BR>Now go down 13 lines  <BR> <BR>Look at the second block. The first line says ID.These are all of his IDs.  <BR>Larry - Anderson - Telephone Co. - Gus - Officer &#40;more&#41;  <BR>Also all of the numbers fall in this block. This may be the most important thing if we can figure out their significance.  <BR> <BR>Go down 13 lines  <BR> <BR>Look at the third block. The first line says RUSE. These are the ruses he used.  <BR>Realtor - Insurance - Serviceman - For Sale - Help - Lost Dog.  <BR> <BR>I know this is not a huge find, but a find nonetheless.  <BR>------------------------ <BR> <BR>and here is a link to where I posted &#34;IQ´s&#34; post, it is further down than Wichitaboys´s: <BR><a href="http://www.catchbtk.com/discus/messages/1/197.html" target=_top>http://www.catchbtk.com/discus/messages/1/197.html</a> ?1108660735<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7795-->
<!--Post: 7796--><!--Time: 1108685753-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7796"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Jrl<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Jrl<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 17, 2005 - 4:15 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Well, we obviously know he didn&#39;t always need a ruse.  Sometimes he was already in their homes waiting, having broken in.  No ruse there.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7796-->
<!--Post: 7801--><!--Time: 1108686709-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7801"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:nugzter@yahoo.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Nugzter<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Nugzter<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 17, 2005 - 4:31 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Maybe he used a ruse to case the victim. He could have gone to their homes before he broke in. Used the telephone repair or my dog is lost ruse. Then returned when victim was not home, then waited.  Did LE ask Anna if she had been solicited by someone before the break in?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7801-->
