<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7808"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:embersageblue@aol.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 17, 2005 - 4:51 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Ok thank you IQ,and skov for correcting me, he did a great job with it and so has everyone else, yeah the next thing I wanted to do was try to link some of those IDs, etc together. You could walk around the entire neighboorhood looking for a lost dog and no one would notice, because it&#39;s a normal thing to do.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7808-->
<!--Post: 7812--><!--Time: 1108688664-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7812"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:nugzter@yahoo.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Nugzter<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Nugzter<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 17, 2005 - 5:04 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->The cut phone line victims could have gone as follows. Not sue if murders were commited during day or night time but hee is the idea. <BR>He cuts phone line, then goes to door saying he fom the phone co. and askes victim to check there phone line is working while victim is checking phone, he pulls out weapon and does is thing.  <BR>We used to pull a pank as teenagers simila to this, but not harming anyone. <BR>We would call a random tel number and say we were fom the phone co. We would tell the peson we wee testing the phone line and not to answer phone when it rang. We would call 2 or 3 times and eventualy the peson would answe the phone. When they answered we would sceam into the phone and cuss the person out for answering. Its a stupid prank call, but it gives the proof about how people will do things that strangers tell them to do. He must have know this to exploit his victims.  <BR>School ID: <BR>Now this is fairly complicated but I think the victims with childen could have seen this ruse.  <BR>He played a truent officer or something along the lines. Not too sure on that tho. Would have taken alot of time stalking someone to pull of the school ID ruse.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7812-->
<!--Post: 7873--><!--Time: 1108729557-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7873"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:embersageblue@aol.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 18, 2005 - 4:25 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I believe the murders were in the morning, someone correct me if I am wrong. The phone line thing I agree with. Someone saw a van in the neighboorhood and a man wearing a gray uniform. There was something on the side of the van, a pic. or symbol. Anyone have an Idea what it was. That could be a big help if we could trace that van.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7873-->
