<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7875"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:embersageblue@aol.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 18, 2005 - 4:42 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Lorenap, good call on the chapter Ideas. I have been thinking about the &#34;Will There Be More.&#34; I think he killed more people, one&#39;s that we could have linked him to, Like Dee, Strange that she and another woman both ate in the same Restaurant &#40;I believe in Park City&#41; someone correct me please. Anyway both women died right after eating in the same Restaurant. and One had a brick thrown through her window. Various victims around that area unsolved, some could be links.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
